      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6a11b78d5a52cb2df08803fe|full_name} \n\nAs mentioned in the Canny text, this issue can be reproduced in VCC environment using the custom template feature.\n\nALCOM is only the thing that led the author to discover this fact.\n\nThe fact that a bug exists in the SDK and the fact that ALCOM encountered this by behaving differently from VCC are separate issues, so I think they should be addressed individually.\n\nThat said, regardless of whether or not this bug should be reported, it’s ultimately up to the VRChat team to decide how much priority to give to fixing it, I think.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "6a1344e2ec6a4698b0d98442",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "6a11b78d5a52cb2df08803fe",
